(9. Compiler Pipeline) Tj
0 -14 Td
(Tokenizer: emits token stream and panic recoveries.) Tj
0 -14 Td
(Parser: constructs AST with node spans and trace.) Tj
0 -14 Td
(Semantic analysis: performs type checks and symbol validation.) Tj
0 -14 Td
(IR generation: emits instruction-like representation.) Tj
0 -14 Td
(Execution: walks AST and records timeline snapshots.) Tj
0 -14 Td
(Phrase-level parser recovery can auto-insert missing ? in recoverable contexts,) Tj
0 -14 Td
(while panic mode can skip invalid lexemes and continue compilation.) Tj
